1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:10,008
Zilzila bo'ldi, shundaymi? Bugungi videomiz nima haqida? — Favqulodda vaziyatlarga tayyorgarlik haqida.

2
00:00:10,008 --> 00:00:11,508
1-qism: Kyushudagi zilzila

3
00:00:11,508 --> 00:00:13,641
Xayrli tong!

4
00:00:13,665 --> 00:00:16,149
Xayrli tong!

5
00:00:16,172 --> 00:00:19,790
Bugun ertalab televideniyedagi yangiliklarni ko'rdingizmi?

6
00:00:19,813 --> 00:00:23,447
Yo'q, hali ko'rmadim.

7
00:00:23,470 --> 00:00:26,036
Nima bo'ldi-ku?

8
00:00:26,059 --> 00:00:31,143
Bugun ertalab Kyushuda kuchli zilzila bo'ldi-ku!

9
00:00:31,167 --> 00:00:34,001
Ha?! Rostdanmi?

10
00:00:34,024 --> 00:00:36,399
Qachon bo'lgan?

11
00:00:36,422 --> 00:00:39,556
Ertalab soat oltida.

12
00:00:39,579 --> 00:00:43,379
Men o'sha vaqtda uxlab yotgan edim.

13
00:00:43,401 --> 00:00:46,484
Bu yerda tebranish sezilmadi-ku.

14
00:00:46,508 --> 00:00:50,575
Ha, bu yerda hech qanday muammo yo'q.

15
00:00:50,598 --> 00:00:53,849
Kyushudagi zilzila kuchli bo'lganmi?

16
00:00:53,872 --> 00:00:58,146
Ha, juda kuchli edi.

17
00:00:58,170 --> 00:01:00,981
Jarohat olganlar bormi?

18
00:01:01,005 --> 00:01:05,972
Ha, yangiliklarda bir ayol yig'lab yurganini ko'rsatishdi.

19
00:01:05,996 --> 00:01:08,729
Bu juda achinarli.

20
00:01:08,752 --> 00:01:11,602
Shaharlar xavfsizmi?

21
00:01:11,626 --> 00:01:15,393
Eski uylar biroz shikastlangan.

22
00:01:15,416 --> 00:01:19,749
Tsunami kelganmi?

23
00:01:19,772 --> 00:01:23,972
Yo'q, tsunami kelmadi.

24
00:01:23,995 --> 00:01:26,628
Oh, bu yaxshi yangilik.

25
00:01:26,651 --> 00:01:30,549
Yaponiya haqiqatan ham zilzilalar ko'p bo'ladigan mamlakat ekan.

26
00:01:30,573 --> 00:01:33,906
Men har doim qo'rqib yuraman.

27
00:01:33,929 --> 00:01:37,420
Ha, Yaponiyada tez-tez zilzilalar bo'ladi.

28
00:01:37,444 --> 00:01:42,417
Men bugun ertalab oilamga qo'ng'iroq qildim.

29
00:01:42,440 --> 00:01:45,646
Oilangiz xavotirda edimi?

30
00:01:45,669 --> 00:01:49,436
Ha, juda xavotirda edilar.

31
00:01:49,459 --> 00:01:51,525
Albatta.

32
00:01:51,548 --> 00:01:54,482
Kyushuda do'stlaringiz bormi?

33
00:01:54,505 --> 00:01:57,505
Yo'q, yo'q.

34
00:01:57,528 --> 00:02:01,661
Mening universitetdagi do'stlarimdan biri Kyushuda.

35
00:02:01,684 --> 00:02:03,650
U yaxshimi?

36
00:02:03,673 --> 00:02:06,446
Darhol qo'ng'iroq qilsam bo'ladimi?

37
00:02:06,470 --> 00:02:10,365
Ha, keyinroq unga xabar yozaman.

38
00:02:10,388 --> 00:02:19,397
Bugungi videoning ssenariysi tavsif va eng yaxshi kommentariydan yuklab olishingiz mumkin. Yuklab olishdan oldin, iltimos, fikr bildiring!

39
00:02:19,397 --> 00:02:20,897
2-qism: Dam olish va xotirjamlik

40
00:02:20,897 --> 00:02:23,190
Charchadingizmi, dam oling!

41
00:02:23,213 --> 00:02:25,284
Biroz dam olamizmi?

42
00:02:25,307 --> 00:02:27,787
Ha, keling, dam olamiz.

43
00:02:27,811 --> 00:02:30,244
Qahva ichamizmi?

44
00:02:30,268 --> 00:02:32,753
Ha, ichaman.

45
00:02:32,776 --> 00:02:35,343
Har doim raxmat!

46
00:02:35,366 --> 00:02:39,499
Bugun ertalab Kyushudagi zilzila juda kuchli bo'ldi-ku.

47
00:02:39,522 --> 00:02:43,408
Ha, haqiqatan ham juda kuchli edi.

48
00:02:43,432 --> 00:02:46,299
Yangiliklarni ko'rib, hayron bo'ldim.

49
00:02:46,322 --> 00:02:50,014
Kyushuda oila yoki do'stlaringiz bormi?

50
00:02:50,037 --> 00:02:54,372
Ha, ota-onam Kyushuda yashaydilar.

51
00:02:54,395 --> 00:02:57,239
Nima?! Ota-onangizmi?!

52
00:02:57,262 --> 00:02:59,801
Allaqachon telefon qildingizmi?

53
00:02:59,824 --> 00:03:03,429
Ha, ertalab darhol telefon qildim.

54
00:03:03,453 --> 00:03:06,419
Ota-onangiz xavfsiz edilarmi?

55
00:03:06,442 --> 00:03:09,176
Ha, xavfsiz edilar.

56
00:03:09,198 --> 00:03:11,532
Ikkalasi ham sogʻ-salomat edilar.

57
00:03:11,555 --> 00:03:15,121
Shundaymi? Bu juda yaxshi.

58
00:03:15,144 --> 00:03:18,811
Ha, ularning ovozi eshitib, xotirjam boʻldim.

59
00:03:18,834 --> 00:03:22,367
Ota-onangiz jarohat olmaganlarmi?

60
00:03:22,390 --> 00:03:25,678
Ha, jarohat yoʻq.

61
00:03:25,702 --> 00:03:28,702
Uy ichida ham hammasi yaxshimi?

62
00:03:28,725 --> 00:03:31,525
Bir necha likopchalar sindi.

63
00:03:31,548 --> 00:03:35,281
Lekin, katta muammo yoʻq.

64
00:03:35,304 --> 00:03:39,504
Shundaymi? Suv va ovqat bormi?

65
00:03:39,527 --> 00:03:42,102
Ha, koʻp bor.

66
00:03:42,125 --> 00:03:45,742
Ota-onam har doim suv zaxirasini tayyorlab qoʻyishadi.

67
00:03:45,766 --> 00:03:48,173
Bu ajoyib ekan.

68
00:03:48,196 --> 00:03:50,069
Xotirjamlik.

69
00:03:50,093 --> 00:03:53,873
Lekin, onam biroz charchagan edi.

70
00:03:53,896 --> 00:03:56,935
Tun davomida ham unchalik uxlamadi.

71
00:03:56,958 --> 00:04:01,492
Ha, zilzila paytida charchash odatiy hol.

72
00:04:01,515 --> 00:04:05,090
Ha, men ham juda xavotirda edim.

73
00:04:05,113 --> 00:04:09,379
Yondosh doʻstlaringizga ham aloqaga chiqdingizmi?

74
00:04:09,402 --> 00:04:12,672
Ha, doʻstlar ham xavfsiz edilar.

75
00:04:12,696 --> 00:04:14,263
Yaxshi boʻldi.

76
00:04:14,286 --> 00:04:17,303
Mening oilam Tokioda.

77
00:04:17,326 --> 00:04:20,770
Tokioda ham tez-tez zilzilalar boʻladi, shundaymi?

78
00:04:20,794 --> 00:04:25,474
Ha. Shuning uchun keyinroq oilamga telefon qilaman.

79
00:04:25,497 --> 00:04:28,097
Ha, shuni qilsangiz yaxshi boʻlardi.

80
00:04:28,120 --> 00:04:30,413
Yangiliklarni koʻrdim.

81
00:04:30,437 --> 00:04:33,416
Kyuyshudan keyin yomgʻir yogʻadi.

82
00:04:33,439 --> 00:04:35,849
Ha?! Rostdanmi?

83
00:04:35,873 --> 00:04:38,144
Bu xavfli ekan.

84
00:04:38,168 --> 00:04:41,168
Ha, juda xavotirdaman.

85
00:04:41,191 --> 00:04:44,470
Kechqurun yana ota-onamga xabar yozaman.

86
00:04:44,494 --> 00:04:47,027
Ha, shuni qiling.

87
00:04:47,050 --> 00:04:54,155
Bugungi videodagi qayta koʻrish uchun sayt havolasini tavsif qismida va eng yuqori kommentda topishingiz mumkin. *Sayt oldindan ogohlantirmasdan oʻchirilishi mumkin.

88
00:04:54,155 --> 00:04:55,655
3-Sahna: Zilzila paytida oʻz-oʻzini himoya qilish / Zilzila paytida qanday himoya qilish kerak

89
00:04:55,655 --> 00:05:01,934
Aytgin, agar hozir katta zilzila boʻlsa, nima qilasan?

90
00:05:01,958 --> 00:05:06,625
Xoʻsh, avvaliga shoshilinch ravishda tashqariga chiqaman.

91
00:05:06,648 --> 00:05:09,181
Bu xavfli.

92
00:05:09,204 --> 00:05:12,405
Shoshilmasdan, tashqariga chiqmang.

93
00:05:12,428 --> 00:05:14,100
Shundaymi?

94
00:05:14,124 --> 00:05:17,813
Unda, xonada nima qilamiz?

95
00:05:17,836 --> 00:05:21,474
Avvalo, boshni himoya qiling.

96
00:05:21,497 --> 00:05:23,497
Tushunarli.

97
00:05:23,520 --> 00:05:27,120
Sumka yoki yostiq bilan boshni himoya qiling.

98
00:05:27,144 --> 00:05:31,838
Keyin darhol stol tagiga kirib boring.

99
00:05:31,862 --> 00:05:34,695
Stol tagiga, shundaymi?

100
00:05:34,718 --> 00:05:36,156
Tushunarli.

101
00:05:36,180 --> 00:05:40,460
Stol oyogʻini qattiq ushlab turing.

102
00:05:40,484 --> 00:05:41,567
Ha.

103
00:05:41,591 --> 00:05:44,801
Silkinish toʻxtagunicha kutamizmi?

104
00:05:44,824 --> 00:05:47,304
Ha, shunday.

105
00:05:47,327 --> 00:05:51,061
Silkinish toʻxtaganidan keyin olovni oʻchiring.

106
00:05:51,084 --> 00:05:54,851
Ovqat pishirayotganda nima qilasiz?

107
00:05:54,874 --> 00:05:57,912
Darhol olovni oʻchirasizmi?

108
00:05:57,935 --> 00:06:02,738
Kuchli silkinishda olov yaqinida xavf bor.

109
00:06:02,761 --> 00:06:05,761
Qachon olovni oʻchirish kerak?

110
00:06:05,784 --> 00:06:10,017
Silkinish toʻxtaganidan keyin oʻchiring.

111
00:06:10,040 --> 00:06:11,607
Tushunarli.

112
00:06:11,630 --> 00:06:15,163
Avvalo oʻz tanangizni himoya qiling.

113
00:06:15,186 --> 00:06:17,043
Ha, toʻgʻri.

114
00:06:17,067 --> 00:06:20,906
Keyin xonaning eshigini oching.

115
00:06:20,929 --> 00:06:23,900
Nega eshikni ochish kerak?

116
00:06:23,923 --> 00:06:28,257
Zilziladan keyin eshik ochilmay qolishi mumkin.

117
00:06:28,280 --> 00:06:30,013
Anlayapman.

118
00:06:30,036 --> 00:06:33,048
Qochish yoʻlini yaratamiz-ku.

119
00:06:33,072 --> 00:06:34,682
Ha.

120
00:06:34,705 --> 00:06:39,072
Keyin derazalar yaqiniga bormang.

121
00:06:39,095 --> 00:06:41,895
Shisha sinishi mumkin-ku.

122
00:06:41,918 --> 00:06:43,416
Ha.

123
00:06:43,439 --> 00:06:46,039
Derazadan uzoqlashing.

124
00:06:46,062 --> 00:06:47,865
Tushunarli.

125
00:06:47,888 --> 00:06:50,971
Poyabzalni qayerga qoʻyasiz?

126
00:06:50,995 --> 00:06:55,668
Krovat yoniga shippak yoki poyabzal qoʻying.

127
00:06:55,691 --> 00:06:59,458
Xonaga shisha parchalari tushishi mumkin-ku.

128
00:06:59,481 --> 00:07:00,914
Ha.

129
00:07:00,937 --> 00:07:03,385
Oyoqlaringizni himoya qiling.

130
00:07:03,409 --> 00:07:07,814
Bugun kechqurun krovat yoniga poyabzal qoʻyaman.

131
00:07:07,837 --> 00:07:11,204
Smartfoningizni ham yaqin joyda saqlang.

132
00:07:11,227 --> 00:07:12,827
Ha.

133
00:07:12,850 --> 00:07:17,109
Tunda qorongʻi boʻladi, smartfon chirogʻidan foydalanamiz.

134
00:07:17,132 --> 00:07:19,911
Juda yaxshi fikr!

135
00:07:19,935 --> 00:07:23,226
Zilzila qoidalarini tekshirish muhim.

136
00:07:23,250 --> 00:07:24,983
Ha.

137
00:07:25,006 --> 00:07:28,651
Vaqt-vaqti bilan ikkimiz tekshirib turamiz.

138
00:07:28,674 --> 00:07:30,247
Ha.

139
00:07:30,270 --> 00:07:31,759
Shunday qilamiz.

140
00:07:31,783 --> 00:07:33,283
4-Sahna: Xonani tartibga solish va kitob javonining xavfi

141
00:07:33,283 --> 00:07:36,449
Yangi xona qanday?

142
00:07:36,472 --> 00:07:39,472
Juda keng.

143
00:07:39,495 --> 00:07:42,729
Menga bu xona yoqdi.

144
00:07:42,752 --> 00:07:46,885
Koʻchib kelganingizdan keyin xonani tartibga solish tugadi-mi?

145
00:07:46,908 --> 00:07:50,154
Ha, taxminan tugadi.

146
00:07:50,177 --> 00:07:52,711
Bugun yordam berganingiz uchun rahmat.

147
00:07:52,734 --> 00:07:57,940
Arzimaydi. Ana bu kitob javoni juda baland ekan-ku.

148
00:07:57,963 --> 00:08:03,011
Ha, kitoblarim koʻp boʻlgani uchun.

149
00:08:03,035 --> 00:08:07,368
Kitob javoni krovatning yaqinida turibdi-ku.

150
00:08:07,391 --> 00:08:12,594
Ha, uxlashdan oldin doimo kitob oʻqiyman.

151
00:08:12,618 --> 00:08:15,951
Bu biroz xavfli.

152
00:08:15,974 --> 00:08:17,832
Nega?

153
00:08:17,856 --> 00:08:22,698
Kuchli zilzilada kitob javoni agʻdarilib ketishi mumkin.

154
00:08:22,722 --> 00:08:24,955
A, shunday ekan.

155
00:08:24,978 --> 00:08:30,229
Krovat ustiga agʻdarilib, juda xavfli boʻladi.

156
00:08:30,253 --> 00:08:33,219
Bu qoʻrqinchli.

157
00:08:33,242 --> 00:08:35,499
Nima qilish kerak?

158
00:08:35,523 --> 00:08:39,557
Avvalo kitob javonining joyini oʻzgartiramiz.

159
00:08:39,580 --> 00:08:42,546
Yaxshi. Qayerga qoʻysak boʻladi?

160
00:08:42,569 --> 00:08:46,236
Ana oʻsha devor oldiga qoʻysak qanday?

161
00:08:46,259 --> 00:08:48,192
Yaxshi koʻrinadi.

162
00:08:48,215 --> 00:08:50,487
Shu yerga qoʻying.

163
00:08:50,510 --> 00:08:55,144
Va kitob javonini devorga mustahkam qilib mahkamlab qoʻying.

164
00:08:55,167 --> 00:08:58,133
Devorga qanday qilib mahkamlash mumkin?

165
00:08:58,156 --> 00:09:02,356
Zilzilaga qarshi maxsus asboblar bor.

166
00:09:02,379 --> 00:09:04,439
Shundaymi?

167
00:09:04,463 --> 00:09:07,334
Ular qayerda?

168
00:09:07,357 --> 00:09:10,240
Yaqin atrofdagi supermarketa bor.

169
00:09:10,264 --> 00:09:12,832
Narxi qimmatmi?

170
00:09:12,855 --> 00:09:15,937
Yoʻq, arzon.

171
00:09:15,961 --> 00:09:18,127
Taxminan 1000 yen.

172
00:09:18,150 --> 00:09:20,841
Bu juda yaxshi.

173
00:09:20,865 --> 00:09:25,198
Hozir birga supermarketa xarid qilishga boring.

174
00:09:25,221 --> 00:09:27,454
Ha, boring.

175
00:09:27,477 --> 00:09:30,644
Yana katta mebellar bormi?

176
00:09:30,667 --> 00:09:33,900
Televizor ham biroz katta.

177
00:09:33,923 --> 00:09:38,211
Unday boʻlsa, televizor uchun ham asboblar xarid qilaylik.

178
00:09:38,235 --> 00:09:40,124
Tushunarli.

179
00:09:40,147 --> 00:09:44,680
Javondagi ogʻir narsalarni pastga qoʻying.

180
00:09:44,703 --> 00:09:48,138
Yuqoriga nima qoʻyish kerak?

181
00:09:48,162 --> 00:09:51,095
Yengil narsalarni qoʻying.

182
00:09:51,118 --> 00:09:52,851
Tushunarli.

183
00:09:52,874 --> 00:09:57,246
Zilzilaga tayyorgarlik koʻrish juda muhim ekan.

184
00:09:57,270 --> 00:10:00,961
Ha, bugun hammasini birga qilamiz.

185
00:10:00,985 --> 00:10:04,385
Ha, iltimos.

186
00:10:04,408 --> 00:10:05,908
5-Sahna: Favqulodda sumkani tayyorlash

187
00:10:05,908 --> 00:10:08,797
Nima qilayapsiz?

188
00:10:08,820 --> 00:10:13,304
Favqulodda ryukzak tayyorlamoqdaman.

189
00:10:13,327 --> 00:10:16,527
Bu zilzila uchun tayyorlangan sumka, shundaymi?

190
00:10:16,550 --> 00:10:19,183
Ha, shunday.

191
00:10:19,206 --> 00:10:22,740
Bugun ichidagi narsalarni tekshiraman.

192
00:10:22,763 --> 00:10:26,938
Sumkada qanday narsalar bor?

193
00:10:26,961 --> 00:10:30,599
Suv va oziq-ovqat bor.

194
00:10:30,623 --> 00:10:33,656
Suv qancha?

195
00:10:33,679 --> 00:10:38,812
500 millilitrli 3 ta plastik butilka bor.

196
00:10:38,835 --> 00:10:42,049
Oziq-ovqat nima?

197
00:10:42,073 --> 00:10:47,140
Uzoq saqlanadigan non va shokolad bor.

198
00:10:47,163 --> 00:10:49,396
Shokolad yaxshi.

199
00:10:49,419 --> 00:10:52,236
Boshqa nimalar bor?

200
00:10:52,259 --> 00:10:55,826
Sochiq va kiyimlar bor.

201
00:10:55,849 --> 00:10:58,582
Choʻntak chirogʻi bormi?

202
00:10:58,605 --> 00:11:01,481
Ha, mana bu yerda.

203
00:11:01,505 --> 00:11:04,305
Batareykalar yangi mi?

204
00:11:04,328 --> 00:11:08,534
A, batareykalar biroz eski ekan.

205
00:11:08,557 --> 00:11:13,032
Unda yangi batareykalar solish kerak.

206
00:11:13,056 --> 00:11:14,823
Albatta.

207
00:11:14,846 --> 00:11:18,612
Keyinroq yangi batareykalar xarid qilaman.

208
00:11:18,635 --> 00:11:20,969
Radio ham bormi?

209
00:11:20,991 --> 00:11:24,559
Ha, kichik radio bor.

210
00:11:24,583 --> 00:11:28,156
Smartfon zaryadlovchi ham muhim.

211
00:11:28,179 --> 00:11:31,912
Ha, mobil batareyka ham solaman.

212
00:11:31,935 --> 00:11:35,190
Dori-darmon va yara bintlari bormi?

213
00:11:35,214 --> 00:11:38,414
Yoʻq, hali solinmagan.

214
00:11:38,437 --> 00:11:43,570
Jarohatlanganda dori-darmonlar kerak boʻladi.

215
00:11:43,593 --> 00:11:45,567
Tushunarli.

216
00:11:45,591 --> 00:11:49,191
Ertaga dorixonaga borib xarid qilaman.

217
00:11:49,214 --> 00:11:51,547
Sumka ogʻirmi?

218
00:11:51,570 --> 00:11:56,241
Biroz ogʻir, lekin yugurishim mumkin.

219
00:11:56,265 --> 00:11:59,298
Sumkani qayerga qoʻyasiz?

220
00:11:59,321 --> 00:12:02,188
Kirish joyi yaqiniga qoʻyaman.

221
00:12:02,211 --> 00:12:06,065
Tez qochish mumkin, yaxshi ekan.

222
00:12:06,089 --> 00:12:11,655
Ha. Sizning uyingizda ham favqulodda sumka bormi?

223
00:12:11,678 --> 00:12:15,413
Yoʻq, hali tayyorlamadim.

224
00:12:15,437 --> 00:12:20,437
Yaponiyada zilzilalar koʻp boʻladi, shuning uchun tayyorlaning.

225
00:12:20,460 --> 00:12:24,460
Ha, men ham shu hafta oxirida tayyorlayman.

226
00:12:24,483 --> 00:12:29,049
Yaxshi favqulodda sumka yaqinagi supermarketda bor.

227
00:12:29,072 --> 00:12:33,439
Unda, yakshanba kuni doʻkonni koʻrsatib yuborasizmi?

228
00:12:33,462 --> 00:12:36,495
Ha, birga boramiz.

229
00:12:36,518 --> 00:12:38,018
6-SAHNA: Favqulodda tayyorgarlik: Suv taʼminoti

230
00:12:38,018 --> 00:12:42,874
Supermarketning favqulodda boʻlimi shu yerda ekan.

231
00:12:42,897 --> 00:12:47,169
Ha, turli xil narsalar bor ekan.

232
00:12:47,193 --> 00:12:51,040
Avvalo, suv sotib olaylik.

233
00:12:51,064 --> 00:12:52,864
Albatta.

234
00:12:52,887 --> 00:12:56,487
Suv eng muhim narsa.

235
00:12:56,510 --> 00:13:00,277
Nechta suv kerak boʻladi?

236
00:13:00,300 --> 00:13:05,571
Bir kishiga kuniga 3 litr kerak.

237
00:13:05,595 --> 00:13:07,574
Shundaymi?

238
00:13:07,597 --> 00:13:11,131
Nechta kunlik suv sotib olamiz?

239
00:13:11,154 --> 00:13:14,987
3 kunlik suv sotib olish yaxshiroq.

240
00:13:15,010 --> 00:13:19,143
Unda, bir kishiga 9 litr kerak boʻladi.

241
00:13:19,166 --> 00:13:23,933
Ha, ikki kishiga 18 litr.

242
00:13:23,956 --> 00:13:26,889
18 litrmi?

243
00:13:26,912 --> 00:13:29,989
Bu juda ogʻir ekan-ku.

244
00:13:30,013 --> 00:13:34,379
Bugun mashinada kelganimiz uchun muammo yoʻq.

245
00:13:34,402 --> 00:13:36,436
Yaxshi boʻldi.

246
00:13:36,459 --> 00:13:39,725
Unda, buni aravaga solamiz.

247
00:13:39,748 --> 00:13:42,548
Keyin ovqat olamiz.

248
00:13:42,571 --> 00:13:46,105
Uzoq saqlanadigan narsalar yaxshi boʻladi.

249
00:13:46,127 --> 00:13:48,294
Nima sotib olamiz?

250
00:13:48,317 --> 00:13:51,357
Konserva qanday?

251
00:13:51,381 --> 00:13:53,114
Yaxshi koʻrinadi.

252
00:13:53,137 --> 00:13:55,393
Koʻp sotib olamiz.

253
00:13:55,417 --> 00:13:59,150
A, non konservasi ham bor ekan.

254
00:13:59,173 --> 00:14:00,340
Eh?

255
00:14:00,363 --> 00:14:03,541
Qutida non bormi?

256
00:14:03,564 --> 00:14:07,498
Ha, juda ham mazali ekan.

257
00:14:07,521 --> 00:14:09,722
Qiziqarli ekan.

258
00:14:09,745 --> 00:14:12,035
Buni ham sotib olamiz.

259
00:14:12,059 --> 00:14:16,325
Ovqatni ham 3 kunlik sotib olish kerak.

260
00:14:16,348 --> 00:14:18,148
Tushunarli.

261
00:14:18,171 --> 00:14:20,705
Karry ham bor ekan.

262
00:14:20,728 --> 00:14:25,814
Uni isitmasdan ham yeyish mumkinmi?

263
00:14:25,838 --> 00:14:29,471
Ha, qutida shunday yozilgan.

264
00:14:29,494 --> 00:14:31,538
Qulay ekan.

265
00:14:31,561 --> 00:14:33,828
Buni ham sotib olamiz.

266
00:14:33,851 --> 00:14:37,855
A, shirinlik ham ozroq sotib olish kerak.

267
00:14:37,878 --> 00:14:40,045
Shokoladmi?

268
00:14:40,067 --> 00:14:45,201
Ha, charchaganimizda shirin narsa yaxshi boʻladi.

269
00:14:45,224 --> 00:14:46,990
Anlayapman.

270
00:14:47,013 --> 00:14:50,461
Unda, shokolad va qand sotib olamiz.

271
00:14:50,485 --> 00:14:54,052
Boshqa kerakli narsalar ham bormi?

272
00:14:54,075 --> 00:14:58,241
Qogʻoz likopchalar va stakanlar ham sotib olamizmi?

273
00:14:58,264 --> 00:15:00,333
Yaxshi koʻrinadi.

274
00:15:00,356 --> 00:15:03,399
Suv to'xtaganda juda qulay.

275
00:15:03,423 --> 00:15:07,225
Ha, yuvishga hojat yo'q-ku.

276
00:15:07,249 --> 00:15:11,182
Endi u yerda javonni ko'rib chiqaylik.

277
00:15:11,205 --> 00:15:14,019
Ha, boring.

278
00:15:14,043 --> 00:15:15,543
7-SAHNA: Favqulodda evakuatsiya joylari / Evakuatsiya joylariga kirish

279
00:15:15,543 --> 00:15:19,209
Bugun ob-havo juda yaxshi ekan, shunday emasmi?

280
00:15:19,232 --> 00:15:23,566
Ha, sayr qilish uchun juda mos ob-havo.

281
00:15:23,589 --> 00:15:29,222
A, u yerda yashil rangli belgi bor-ku.

282
00:15:29,245 --> 00:15:31,279
Rostdan ham.

283
00:15:31,303 --> 00:15:34,269
Nima yozilgan?

284
00:15:34,292 --> 00:15:37,585
“Evakuatsiya joyi” deb yozilgan.

285
00:15:37,609 --> 00:15:40,243
Evakuatsiya joyimi?

286
00:15:40,266 --> 00:15:42,666
Bu nima?

287
00:15:42,688 --> 00:15:47,888
Katta zilzila bo'lsa, hamma shu yerga keladi.

288
00:15:47,911 --> 00:15:50,278
Shundaymi?

289
00:15:50,301 --> 00:15:52,745
Bu bog' ekan-ku.

290
00:15:52,769 --> 00:15:58,775
Ha, bu bog' keng, shuning uchun xavfsiz.

291
00:15:58,798 --> 00:16:03,836
Mening uyim yaqinida ham shunday belgi bor.

292
00:16:03,859 --> 00:16:06,863
Ular qayerda?

293
00:16:06,887 --> 00:16:10,820
Yaqin atrofdagi boshlang'ich maktab oldida.

294
00:16:10,843 --> 00:16:14,684
Boshlang'ich maktab ham evakuatsiya joyi ekan.

295
00:16:14,707 --> 00:16:19,949
Ha. Zilzila bo'lsa, shu maktabga boraman.

296
00:16:19,973 --> 00:16:23,412
Bu juda ham xotirjam.

297
00:16:23,436 --> 00:16:29,494
Lekin kechasi qorong'i bo'ladi, shuning uchun biroz tashvishlanaman.

298
00:16:29,517 --> 00:16:34,170
Bu bog' yaqinida katta yo'l bor.

299
00:16:34,193 --> 00:16:38,242
Ha, bu yo'l yorug'.

300
00:16:38,265 --> 00:16:43,332
Zilzila bo'lsa, shu yorug' yo'l bo'ylab boring.

301
00:16:43,355 --> 00:16:45,569
Tushunarli.

302
00:16:45,592 --> 00:16:48,398
Qorong'i yo'l bo'ylab yurmaymiz.

303
00:16:48,421 --> 00:16:52,193
Uyingiz yaqinidagi xaritani ko'rdingizmi?

304
00:16:52,217 --> 00:16:54,750
Xaritami?

305
00:16:54,773 --> 00:16:58,352
Yo'q, hali ko'rmadim.

306
00:16:58,376 --> 00:17:02,976
Shahar veb-saytida xavf-xatarlik xaritasi bor.

307
00:17:02,998 --> 00:17:06,452
Xavf-xatarlik xaritasi nima?

308
00:17:06,476 --> 00:17:10,443
Xavfli joylarni ko'rsatadigan xarita.

309
00:17:10,466 --> 00:17:13,399
Bu juda ham foydali ekan.

310
00:17:13,422 --> 00:17:17,556
Keyinroq birga shu xaritani ko'rib chiqaylik.

311
00:17:17,579 --> 00:17:20,869
Ha, iltimos, albatta.

312
00:17:20,893 --> 00:17:25,426
Endi shaharda biroz sayr qilaylikmi?

313
00:17:25,449 --> 00:17:27,182
Albatta.

314
00:17:27,205 --> 00:17:30,422
Boshqa belgilarni ham ko'raylik.

315
00:17:30,446 --> 00:17:33,012
Ha, boring.

316
00:17:33,035 --> 00:17:34,535
8-SAHNA: Favqulodda vaziyatlarga tayyorgarlik / Ofatlarga tayyorgarlik

317
00:17:34,535 --> 00:17:37,231
Nima qilayapsiz?

318
00:17:37,255 --> 00:17:42,424
Telefonimning zaryadlovchi batareyasini zaryad qilyapman.

319
00:17:42,448 --> 00:17:45,115
Zaryadlovchi batareyami?

320
00:17:45,138 --> 00:17:47,305
Nega?

321
00:17:47,328 --> 00:17:52,695
Zilzila bo'lsa, elektr to'xtab qolishi mumkin.

322
00:17:52,718 --> 00:17:56,451
A, elektr o'chganda deysizmi?

323
00:17:56,474 --> 00:18:02,474
Ha. Elektr o'chib qolsa, telefonni zaryad qila olmaymiz.

324
00:18:02,497 --> 00:18:06,064
Bu juda ham muammoli ekan.

325
00:18:06,086 --> 00:18:10,184
Ha, oila a'zolari bilan aloqa qila olmaymiz.

326
00:18:10,208 --> 00:18:13,975
Yangiliklarni ham ko'ra olmaymiz.

327
00:18:13,999 --> 00:18:18,999
Shuning uchun doimo zaryadlab turaman.

328
00:18:19,022 --> 00:18:23,189
Zaryadlovchi batareyalaringiz nechtasi bor?

329
00:18:23,212 --> 00:18:26,345
Menda uchta bor.

330
00:18:26,368 --> 00:18:30,970
Uchtami? Ko'p ekan-ku.

331
00:18:30,993 --> 00:18:37,044
Ha. Telefon bilan birga kichik ventilyator ham ishlataman.

332
00:18:37,068 --> 00:18:41,350
Yozda ventilyator juda muhim ekan.

333
00:18:41,373 --> 00:18:45,540
Ha. Konditsioner ishlamaydi, shuning uchun.

334
00:18:45,563 --> 00:18:50,496
Men bir dona mobil batareyaga egaman.

335
00:18:50,519 --> 00:18:53,929
Batareya 100 foizmi?

336
00:18:53,953 --> 00:18:58,119
Yo'q, hozir zaryadlamayapman.

337
00:18:58,142 --> 00:19:00,316
Bu yomon.

338
00:19:00,340 --> 00:19:03,427
Bugun zaryadlab qo'ying.

339
00:19:03,450 --> 00:19:07,850
Ha, uyga qaytib, darhol zaryadlayman.

340
00:19:07,873 --> 00:19:13,407
Boshqa narsa, elektr o'chib qolsa, nima kerak bo'ladi?

341
00:19:13,430 --> 00:19:17,563
Xmm, chiroq kerak bo'ladi.

342
00:19:17,586 --> 00:19:19,553
Ha, toʻgʻri.

343
00:19:19,576 --> 00:19:22,242
Chunki kechasi juda qorong'i bo'ladi.

344
00:19:22,265 --> 00:19:27,398
Chiroq batareyalarini ham ko'p sotib olish kerak.

345
00:19:27,421 --> 00:19:29,055
Yaxshi koʻrinadi.

346
00:19:29,078 --> 00:19:31,711
Qishda nima qilamiz?

347
00:19:31,734 --> 00:19:36,534
Qishda elektr o'chib qolsa, juda sovuq bo'ladi.

348
00:19:36,557 --> 00:19:41,173
Ha. Issiq kiyimlar va adyolni tayyorlab qo'yaman.

349
00:19:41,197 --> 00:19:45,065
Men qizdiruvchi paketlar ham sotib olaman.

350
00:19:45,089 --> 00:19:47,627
Bu yaxshi fikr.

351
00:19:47,650 --> 00:19:51,617
Muzlatgich to'xtaganda nima qilamiz?

352
00:19:51,640 --> 00:19:55,840
Muzlatgichdagi narsalarni tezda yeyish kerak.

353
00:19:55,863 --> 00:19:57,596
Albatta.

354
00:19:57,619 --> 00:20:01,031
Chunki ovqatlar buzilib ketadi.

355
00:20:01,055 --> 00:20:04,188
Elektr haqiqatan ham muhim ekan.

356
00:20:04,211 --> 00:20:09,493
Ha. Zilziladan oldin turli xil tayyorgarlik ko'ramiz.

357
00:20:09,517 --> 00:20:12,211
Birgalikda ehtiyot bo'lamiz.

358
00:20:12,234 --> 00:20:13,734
9-sahna: Dengiz va sunami xavfi / Dengiz go'zalligi va xavflari: Sunami

359
00:20:13,734 --> 00:20:16,502
Dengiz juda chiroyli, shunday emasmi?

360
00:20:16,525 --> 00:20:19,858
Ha, juda chiroyli.

361
00:20:19,881 --> 00:20:22,764
Men dengizni yaxshi ko'raman.

362
00:20:22,787 --> 00:20:24,962
Men ham yaxshi ko'raman.

363
00:20:24,986 --> 00:20:28,619
Lekin zilzila paytida xavfli bo'ladi.

364
00:20:28,642 --> 00:20:30,461
Nega?

365
00:20:30,485 --> 00:20:32,904
Chunki sunami keladi.

366
00:20:32,927 --> 00:20:34,894
Sunamimi?

367
00:20:34,917 --> 00:20:38,317
Ha, juda katta to'lqin.

368
00:20:38,340 --> 00:20:40,306
Rostdanmi?

369
00:20:40,329 --> 00:20:44,696
Ha, juda katta va tez to'lqin.

370
00:20:44,719 --> 00:20:47,392
Bu juda qo'rqinchli.

371
00:20:47,415 --> 00:20:53,249
Ha. Shuning uchun zilziladan keyin dengizga bormang.

372
00:20:53,272 --> 00:20:55,110
Tushunarli.

373
00:20:55,133 --> 00:20:57,346
Daryo-chaylar-chuchuklar-chaylar-chuchuklar-chaylar-chaylar-chaylar-chaylar-chaylar-chaylar-chaylar-chaylar-chaylar-chaylar-chaylar-chaylar-chaylar-chaylar-chaylar-chaylar-chaylar-chaylar-chaylar-chaylar-chaylar-chaylar-chaylar?

374
00:20:57,370 --> 00:20:59,624
Daryolar ham xavfli.

375
00:20:59,647 --> 00:21:02,381
Daryoga ham bormang.

376
00:21:02,404 --> 00:21:04,051
Shundaymi?

377
00:21:04,074 --> 00:21:07,041
Unda qayerga qochamiz?

378
00:21:07,064 --> 00:21:09,664
Baland joylarga qoching.

379
00:21:09,687 --> 00:21:12,020
Baland joylarga, shundaymi?

380
00:21:12,043 --> 00:21:14,610
Misol uchun, qayerlar?

381
00:21:14,633 --> 00:21:17,470
Baland binolar yoki tog'lar.

382
00:21:17,493 --> 00:21:19,186
Tushunarli.

383
00:21:19,210 --> 00:21:21,844
Shoshilamanmi?

384
00:21:21,867 --> 00:21:24,633
Ha, darhol yuguring.

385
00:21:24,656 --> 00:21:27,790
Yuklarimizni nima qilamiz?

386
00:21:27,813 --> 00:21:30,979
Favqulodda sumkani olib ketamizmi?

387
00:21:31,002 --> 00:21:33,686
Yo'q, olib ketmang.

388
00:21:33,709 --> 00:21:37,243
Yo'q, hech narsa bo'lmasa, qiyin bo'ladi-ku.

389
00:21:37,266 --> 00:21:40,799
Lekin tanangiz eng muhim narsa.

390
00:21:40,822 --> 00:21:44,029
Ха, тушунарли.

391
00:21:44,053 --> 00:21:48,137
Денгиз яқинида цунами эскертмаси бор.

392
00:21:48,160 --> 00:21:50,371
Қандай эскертма?

393
00:21:50,394 --> 00:21:53,649
Цунамига эьтибор беринг деган эскертма.

394
00:21:53,673 --> 00:21:57,606
А, ана ўша эскертма шу ерда экани.

395
00:21:57,629 --> 00:21:59,837
Ha, shunday.

396
00:21:59,861 --> 00:22:02,906
Бошқа эскертмалар ҳам борми?

397
00:22:02,929 --> 00:22:06,005
Ҳа, кўк рангдаги эскертмалар ҳам бор.

398
00:22:06,028 --> 00:22:08,562
Кўк эскертма нима?

399
00:22:08,585 --> 00:22:11,218
Қутулиш жойи эскертмаси.

400
00:22:11,241 --> 00:22:13,374
Evakuatsiya joyimi?

401
00:22:13,397 --> 00:22:16,964
Ҳа, бу барча кишилар қочиб кетадиган жой.

402
00:22:16,987 --> 00:22:19,962
Ана ўша кўк эскертма туриб турган жойда, шунингдекми?

403
00:22:19,985 --> 00:22:23,678
Ҳа. У ер хавфсиз жой.

404
00:22:23,702 --> 00:22:28,268
Денгиз яқинида сайр қилганда доим эскертмаларга қараман.

405
00:22:28,291 --> 00:22:31,225
Ҳа, эьтиборли бўлинг.

406
00:22:31,248 --> 00:22:32,748
10-сахна: Янгиликлар дастури орқали канжи ўрганиш

407
00:22:32,748 --> 00:22:36,081
Сиз телефонингизга қараяпсиз.

408
00:22:36,104 --> 00:22:38,471
Nima qilayapsiz?

409
00:22:38,494 --> 00:22:42,305
Японча янгиликлар ўқияпсиз.

410
00:22:42,328 --> 00:22:46,294
Лекин канжилар қийин экан.

411
00:22:46,317 --> 00:22:48,727
Зилзила хақидаги янгиликми?

412
00:22:48,751 --> 00:22:51,784
Ha, shunday.

413
00:22:51,807 --> 00:22:55,266
Эрталабги зилзила янгиликларини кўрмоқчиман.

414
00:22:55,289 --> 00:23:00,100
Яхши, сизга бир яхши дастурни кўрсатайликми?

415
00:23:00,124 --> 00:23:01,858
Дастурми?

416
00:23:01,881 --> 00:23:04,335
Қандай дастур?

417
00:23:04,358 --> 00:23:08,325
Янгилик ва обу-ҳаво хақидаги дастур.

418
00:23:08,348 --> 00:23:11,353
Япон дастурими?

419
00:23:11,376 --> 00:23:15,043
Ha, shunday.

420
00:23:15,066 --> 00:23:17,444
NHKнинг фалокатлардан сақланиш дастури.

421
00:23:17,467 --> 00:23:20,082
NHK экан.

422
00:23:20,106 --> 00:23:22,987
Телевизорда кўп кўраман.

423
00:23:23,011 --> 00:23:26,786
Бу дастур жуда қулай экани.

424
00:23:26,809 --> 00:23:29,264
Нима учун қулай?

425
00:23:29,288 --> 00:23:33,365
Чет тилларда янгиликларни ўқишингиз мумкин.

426
00:23:33,388 --> 00:23:36,022
Ha?! Rostdanmi?

427
00:23:36,045 --> 00:23:37,724
Ha.

428
00:23:37,747 --> 00:23:41,617
Инглизча ва бошқа тиллар бор.

429
00:23:41,641 --> 00:23:45,308
Менинг тилим ҳам борми?

430
00:23:45,331 --> 00:23:50,697
Ҳа, кўп тиллар бор, муаммо йўқ.

431
00:23:50,720 --> 00:23:52,954
Bu juda yaxshi.

432
00:23:52,977 --> 00:23:56,210
Менинг телефонимни кўрсатайин.

433
00:23:56,233 --> 00:23:58,433
Шу.

434
00:23:58,456 --> 00:24:01,223
А, ростдан хам шу экани.

435
00:24:01,246 --> 00:24:05,012
Менинг тилимда ўқишим мумкин экан.

436
00:24:05,035 --> 00:24:06,904
Ha.

437
00:24:06,928 --> 00:24:11,928
Катта зилзила бўлса, дарҳол хабар келади.

438
00:24:11,951 --> 00:24:15,006
Бу жуда кўнгилга ором бағишади.

439
00:24:15,030 --> 00:24:19,231
Қутулиш жойларининг харитасини ҳам кўришингиз мумкин.

440
00:24:19,255 --> 00:24:22,426
Қочиш жойларининг харитаси, шунингдекми?

441
00:24:22,450 --> 00:24:24,819
Жуда қулай.

442
00:24:24,842 --> 00:24:26,417
Ha.

443
00:24:26,441 --> 00:24:29,459
Цунами эьтибори ҳам мавжуд.

444
00:24:29,482 --> 00:24:35,049
Мен доим тилни тушуна олмайман, шунинг учун бир оз хавотим қўймас эдим.

445
00:24:35,072 --> 00:24:39,605
Бу дастур борлиги учун энди муаммо йўқ.

446
00:24:39,628 --> 00:24:42,807
Мен ҳам бу дастурни хоҳлайман.

447
00:24:42,830 --> 00:24:47,109
Энди юклаб олайликми?

448
00:24:47,133 --> 00:24:49,299
Ҳа, илтимос.

449
00:24:49,322 --> 00:24:52,089
Пул тушадими?

450
00:24:52,112 --> 00:24:55,888
Yo'q, pul talab qilinmaydi.

451
00:24:55,911 --> 00:24:57,845
Bepul.

452
00:24:57,868 --> 00:24:59,714
Yaxshi boʻldi.

453
00:24:59,737 --> 00:25:02,337
Qanday qilib o'rnatish mumkin?

454
00:25:02,360 --> 00:25:04,859
Men sizga yordam beraman.

455
00:25:04,883 --> 00:25:07,450
Iltimos, telefoningizni bering.

456
00:25:07,473 --> 00:25:10,039
Ha, rahmat.

457
00:25:10,062 --> 00:25:12,396
Tayyor, tugadi.

458
00:25:12,419 --> 00:25:15,152
Iltimos, ilovani oching.

459
00:25:15,175 --> 00:25:17,042
Ha.

460
00:25:17,065 --> 00:25:20,498
O, tilimga o'zgardi!

461
00:25:20,521 --> 00:25:22,696
Yaxshi bo'ldi, shunday emasmi?

462
00:25:22,719 --> 00:25:26,052
Ajoyib ilova haqida bilib oldim.

463
00:25:26,075 --> 00:25:28,675
Rostdan, katta rahmat!

464
00:25:28,698 --> 00:25:33,698
Yo'q, har kuni yangiliklarni ko'rib turing.

465
00:25:33,721 --> 00:25:36,321
Ha, albatta.